{"type":"message","id":"01c965ab","parentId":"45c4dc0a","timestamp":"2026-05-03T07:45:07.657Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking which model I want to use for the programming and deployment work. They're referring to the ACP session that I just tried to create but failed because thread bindings aren't available for webchat.\n\nLet me think about this. The options for coding agents would be:\n1. **Codex** (built-in Zed Industries Codex ACP) - good for TypeScript/Node.js work\n2. **Claude Code** (Claude ACP) - excellent for coding\n3. **Gemini CLI** - also capable\n4. **Cursor** - IDE-based\n5. **OpenClaw itself** - I could do the coding myself\n\nThe ACP session tried with Codex but failed on thread binding (webchat limitation). Let me retry without `thread: true` since webchat doesn't support thread bindings.\n\nActually, looking at the error: \"Thread bindings are unavailable for webchat.\" This means I can't create a persistent thread-bound session from the webchat channel. But I should still be able to spawn an isolated ACP session without the thread binding.\n\nLet me retry the spawn without `thread: true` and without `mode: \"session\"`, so it runs as a one-shot isolated ACP session.\n\nActually, let me re-read the error. It says `thread_binding_invalid` - thread bindings are unavailable for webchat. So I should retry without `thread: true`. \n\nLet me just proceed with spawning without thread and without session mode - just a simple one-shot ACP session to do the work.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Thread binding non funziona da webchat, ma è un dettaglio tecnico — riprovo senza.\n\nPer la tua domanda: per coding TypeScript/Node.js con Fastify e Prisma, **Codex** è la scelta migliore — è ottimizzato per codebase TypeScript, fa parte di Zed Industries, e ha context window ampia per progetti strutturati. Ma anche **Claude Code** o **Gemini CLI** sono validi.\n\nIo propendo per **Codex** — parto subito con l'implementazione del backend (Fase A). Mi confermi o preferisci un altro agente?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":164,"output":465,"cacheRead":47360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47989,"cost":{"input":0.00002296,"output":0.00013020000000000002,"cacheRead":0.0013260799999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00147924}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777794299743,"responseId":"88abd6a0-337b-4d43-a605-b390ecc0fefd"}}
