{"type":"message","id":"0e2d5ec9","parentId":"141c20c1","timestamp":"2026-05-03T07:55:16.717Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All tests pass perfectly:\n\n1. ✅ Register → 201, returns user + JWT\n2. ✅ Login → 200, returns user + JWT\n3. ✅ Me → 200, returns user data\n4. ✅ Create People → 201, creates person\n5. ✅ Create Project → 201, creates project linked to person, logs activity\n6. ✅ List Projects → 200, returns projects list\n7. ✅ Dashboard → 200, returns metrics, stage distribution, recent activity\n8. ✅ Nested conversations → 201, creates conversation under project\n\nThe entire backend foundation (Fase A) is built and working. Let me summarize for AleX.\n\nLet me also kill the server and clean up the test database.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Tutti i test passano. Ecco il riepilogo della **Fase A completata**:\n\n```\nensoria-api/\n├── prisma/\n│   ├── schema.prisma          # 11 modelli (User → Activity)\n│   └── dev.db                 # SQLite database creato\n├── prisma.config.ts           # Config Prisma 7\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts               # Entry point\n│   ├── app.ts                 # Fastify app factory\n│   ├── config.ts              # Env config\n│   ├── types/index.ts         # JWT payload + Fastify augment\n│   ├── lib/\n│   │   ├── prisma.ts          # PrismaClient singleton (better-sqlite3 adapter)\n│   │   └── errors.ts          # AppError + error handler\n│   ├── plugins/auth.ts        # JWT auth decorator\n│   └── modules/\n│       ├── auth/              # Register, Login, Me\n│       ├── people/            # CRUD + stage change + search/filter\n│       ├── projects/          # CRUD + stage change + nested resources\n│       ├── conversations/     # GET + POST\n│       ├── requirements/      # Full CRUD\n│       ├── milestones/        # Full CRUD\n│       ├── collaborators/     # GET, POST, DELETE\n│       ├── plans/             # Full CRUD + versioning\n│       ├── files/             # GET + POST\n│       └── dashboard/         # Metrics + stage distribution + activity\n```\n\n**Endpoint testati con successo:**\n- `POST /api/auth/register` → 201 ✅\n- `POST /api/auth/login` → 200 ✅\n- `GET /api/auth/me` → 200 ✅\n- `POST /api/people` → 201 ✅\n- `POST /api/projects` → 201 ✅ (con FK cascade funzionante)\n- `GET /api/dashboard` → 200 ✅ (metriche, stage distribuzione, attività)\n- `POST /api/projects/:id/conversations` → 201 ✅\n\n**Ora sono pronto per la Fase B — Frontend Foundation** (Vite + React + shadcn/ui). Vuoi che proceda?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":1886,"output":658,"cacheRead":103808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106352,"cost":{"input":0.00026404,"output":0.00018424,"cacheRead":0.002906624,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.003354904}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777794905978,"responseId":"052ff22a-2a10-45b7-9682-f6794ba9a356"}}
