{"type":"message","id":"fbaf440a","parentId":"d40382df","timestamp":"2026-05-03T07:55:27.868Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"AleX is saying that as a fallback for Codex (which wasn't working due to auth), I can use **DeepSeek V4 Code** model. But actually, I already wrote all the backend code myself and it's working. The ACP session to use Codex wasn't the path forward - I did it manually and it's done.\n\nNow AleX is asking about the next step - the frontend (Fase B and C). \n\nFor the frontend, I can either:\n1. Continue writing it myself\n2. Try spawning a sub-agent with DeepSeek V4 Code model to generate the frontend\n\nGiven that the ACP runtime had issues with Codex, and AleX is offering DeepSeek V4 Code as fallback for coding work, I think the most practical approach is to continue doing it myself since I already have full context and the backend is done.\n\nBut wait - maybe I should try spawning a sub-agent session with `runtime: \"subagent\"` and model set to `deepseek/deepseek-v4-code` to handle the frontend scaffold. That's different from ACP - it would spawn another OpenClaw sub-agent with that model.\n\nActually, for efficiency, let me just keep building. The backend took maybe 10 minutes to write end-to-end. The frontend scaffold (Vite + React + shadcn/ui) is more involved but I can do it efficiently.\n\nLet me propose to AleX: I'll continue building the frontend myself since ACP had issues, but I can use DeepSeek V4 Code as the model for any sub-agent work if needed.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Grazie AleX, segno la preferenza. Per ora ho scritto tutto il backend manualmente — è andato liscio e funziona tutto. Per il frontend posso continuare allo stesso modo, oppure provare a spawnare un sub-agente con DeepSeek V4 Code per lo scaffold iniziale.\n\nIl backend è **completamente funzionante** — auth passato, CRUD people/projects, nested routes, dashboard metrics. Tutto testato live.\n\nProcedo con la **Fase B — Frontend Foundation**? Se preferisci, lo faccio direttamente io per velocità, altrimenti proviamo DeepSeek V4 Code come coding sub-agente."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":262,"output":490,"cacheRead":106240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106992,"cost":{"input":0.00003668,"output":0.0001372,"cacheRead":0.0029747199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0031485999999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777794916793,"responseId":"0fc52225-09de-4d33-ad49-75e0fb26a8ca"}}
