{"type":"message","id":"aaa30c0f","parentId":"c9aaff23","timestamp":"2026-05-03T07:56:13.926Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"AleX wants me to proceed with Phase B (Frontend Foundation) using DeepSeek V4 Code as a coding sub-agent. Let me:\n\n1. First, let me check if there's a DeepSeek V4 Code agent available via the agents_list or sessions_spawn with subagent runtime.\n\nActually, DeepSeek V4 Code is listed in the model aliases:\n- DeepSeek V4 Code: deepseek/deepseek-v4-code\n\nSo this is a model, not an ACP harness agent. I can spawn a subagent with this model. Let me spawn a subagent with `runtime: \"subagent\"` and specify the model as `deepseek/deepseek-v4-code`.\n\nLet me prepare the task for the subagent. The Phase B covers:\n- B1: Scaffold (Vite + React + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui)\n- B2: App setup (Router, AppLayout, ProtectedRoute)\n- B3: Auth UI (LoginPage, RegisterPage, auth store)\n- B4: API layer (lib/api.ts, TanStack Query hooks)\n- B5: Shared components\n\nThis is a lot of work for a single subagent. Let me spawn it with a comprehensive task.\n\nThe project will be at `/Users/alessio/.openclaw/workspace/ensoria-ui/`\n\nLet me prepare the full context for the subagent. I need to give it enough context about the API, the backend it needs to connect to, and the full frontend structure.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_LJvHMIPBjaQgvG1MlS201000","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/Users/alessio/.openclaw/workspace/PHASE2-IMPL-PLAN.md","offset":540,"limit":260}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":189,"output":417,"cacheRead":82304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82910,"cost":{"input":0.00002646,"output":0.00011676000000000001,"cacheRead":0.002304512,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0024477319999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777794964345,"responseId":"d570d551-03fe-4a0e-bfb7-3c407bf9a28f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d02b92c2","parentId":"aaa30c0f","timestamp":"2026-05-03T07:56:15.364Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_LJvHMIPBjaQgvG1MlS201000","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n---\n\n## 5. Component Tree Frontend\n\n```\n<App>\n  <QueryClientProvider>\n    <BrowserRouter>\n      <Routes>\n        <Route path=\"/login\" element={<LoginPage />} />\n        <Route path=\"/register\" element={<RegisterPage />} />\n        <Route element={<ProtectedRoute />}>\n          <Route element={<AppLayout />}>\n            ← AppLayout contiene Sidebar + Header + Outlet →\n            \n            <Route path=\"/\" element={<DashboardPage />} />\n            <Route path=\"/people\" element={<PeoplePage />} />\n            <Route path=\"/people/:id\" element={<PeopleDetailPage />} />\n            <Route path=\"/projects\" element={<ProjectsPage />} />\n            <Route path=\"/projects/:id\" element={<ProjectSpacePage />} />\n            <Route path=\"/settings\" element={<SettingsPage />} />\n          </Route>\n        </Route>\n      </Routes>\n    </BrowserRouter>\n  </QueryClientProvider>\n</App>\n```\n\n### AppLayout Structure\n\n```\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Header                                           │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │  Search (Cmd+K)          User Avatar ▼      │  │\n│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n├──────┬────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│      │                                            │\n│ Side │  Main Content (Outlet)                     │\n│ bar  │                                            │\n│      │                                            │\n│ 🏠   │                                            │\n│ Dash │                                            │\n│      │                                            │\n│ 👤   │                                            │\n│ Peop │                                            │\n│      │                                            │\n│ 📊   │                                            │\n│ Proj │                                            │\n│      │                                            │\n│ ⚙️   │                                            │\n│ Sett │                                            │\n│      │                                            │\n└──────┴────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Pagina Dashboard\n\n```\n<DashboardPage>\n  <MetricCard label=\"Persone Totali\" value={42} icon={👤} />\n  <MetricCard label=\"Progetti Attivi\" value={18} icon={📊} />\n  <MetricCard label=\"Pipeline Value\" value={€125K} icon={💰} />\n  <MetricCard label=\"Win Rate\" value={35%} icon={🎯} />\n  \n  <KanbanBoard>                              ← Mini pipeline su dashboard\n    <KanbanColumn stage=\"Contact\">\n      <ProjectCard /> ...\n    </KanbanColumn>\n    <KanbanColumn stage=\"Opportunity\">\n      <ProjectCard /> ...\n    </KanbanColumn>\n    ...\n  </KanbanBoard>\n  \n  <ActivityFeed />                           ← Attività recenti\n</DashboardPage>\n```\n\n### Pagina People\n\n```\n<PeoplePage>\n  <Header + Search + Filter>\n  <PeopleTable>\n    <PeopleRow name={} type={} stage=<StageBadge /> email={} projects={} />\n  </PeopleTable>\n  <Dialog>←<PeopleForm /> → Create/Edit</Dialog>\n</PeoplePage>\n```\n\n### Pagina ProjectSpace\n\n```\n<ProjectSpacePage>\n  <ProjectHeader>                          ← Nome, stage, value, cliente\n    <StageBadge />\n    <StageChanger />                       ← Dropdown per cambiare stage\n  </ProjectHeader>\n  \n  <Tabs defaultValue=\"conversations\">\n    <TabsList>\n      <TabsTrigger value=\"conversations\">💬 Conversations</TabsTrigger>\n      <TabsTrigger value=\"files\">📎 Files</TabsTrigger>\n      <TabsTrigger value=\"requirements\">📋 Requirements</TabsTrigger>\n      <TabsTrigger value=\"roadmap\">🗺️ Roadmap</TabsTrigger>\n      <TabsTrigger value=\"collaborators\">👥 Collaborators</TabsTrigger>\n      <TabsTrigger value=\"plans\">📐 Plans</TabsTrigger>\n    </TabsList>\n    \n    <TabsContent value=\"conversations\">\n      <ConversationFeed />                 ← Timeline di conversazioni\n      <ConversationForm />                 ← Aggiungi conversazione\n    </TabsContent>\n    \n    <TabsContent value=\"files\">\n      <FileList />\n      <FileUpload />\n    </TabsContent>\n    \n    <TabsContent value=\"requirements\">\n      <RequirementList />\n      <RequirementForm />\n    </TabsContent>\n    \n    <TabsContent value=\"roadmap\">\n      <MilestoneList />\n      <MilestoneForm />\n    </TabsContent>\n    \n    <TabsContent value=\"collaborators\">\n      <CollaboratorList />\n      <AddCollaborator />\n    </TabsContent>\n    \n    <TabsContent value=\"plans\">\n      <PlanList />\n      <PlanForm />\n    </TabsContent>\n  </Tabs>\n</ProjectSpacePage>\n```\n\n---\n\n## 6. Route Map Frontend\n\n| Path | Page | Description |\n|------|------|-------------|\n| `/login` | LoginPage | Auth login form |\n| `/register` | RegisterPage | First-time admin registration |\n| `/` | DashboardPage | Pipeline + metrics + activity feed |\n| `/people` | PeoplePage | Table/list of all people |\n| `/people/:id` | PeopleDetailPage | Person details + their projects |\n| `/projects` | ProjectsPage | Full Kanban pipeline board |\n| `/projects/:id` | ProjectSpacePage | Project detail with 6 tabs |\n| `/settings` | SettingsPage | App settings (future) |\n\n### Sidebar Navigation Items\n\n| Icon | Label | Path | Badge |\n|------|-------|------|-------|\n| 🏠 | Dashboard | `/` | — |\n| 👤 | People | `/people` | Count |\n| 📊 | Projects | `/projects` | Active count |\n| ⚙️ | Settings | `/settings` | — |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Auth Flow\n\n```\nRegistration (first use):\n  POST /api/auth/register → { user, token }\n  → Token salvato in localStorage\n  → Redirect a Dashboard\n\nLogin:\n  POST /api/auth/login → { user, token }\n  → Token salvato in localStorage\n  → Redirect a Dashboard\n\nAuth guard (frontend):\n  <ProtectedRoute>\n    → Check token in localStorage\n    → GET /api/auth/me per validare\n    → Se 401 → redirect a /login\n    → Se OK → render child route\n\nLogout:\n  → Remove token da localStorage\n  → Redirect a /login\n\nBackend auth guard (Fastify hook):\n  → Extract Bearer token\n  → Verify JWT\n  → Decode user info → attach a request\n  → Se invalido → 401\n```\n\n### Zustand Auth Store\n\n```typescript\ninterface AuthState {\n  user: User | null;\n  token: string | null;\n  isLoading: boolean;\n  login: (email: string, password: string) => Promise<void>;\n  register: (email: string, password: string, name: string) => Promise<void>;\n  logout: () => void;\n  checkAuth: () => Promise<void>;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 8. Data Flow\n\n### Pattern Generale\n\n```\nUser Action → React Component → TanStack Query Hook → fetch() → Fastify Route → Service → Prisma → SQLite\n                                                                                                    ↓\nUser sees UI update ← TanStack Query cache update ← Response JSON ← Fastify reply ← Service ← Prisma\n```\n\n### Esempio: Creazione Persona\n\n```\n1. User compila <PeopleForm /> e clicca \"Salva\"\n2. useMutation da usePeople.ts → POST /api/people con body\n3. people.routes.ts valida con schema Zod → people.service.ts\n4. Service chiama prisma.people.create({ data: {...} })\n5. Service logga attività: Activity.create({ type: \"created\", ... })\n6. Response 201 { data: { id, name, ... } }\n7. TanStack Query invalida key [\"people\"] → refresh lista\n8. UI si aggiorna\n```\n\n### TanStack Query Keys\n\n```typescript\n// Struttura query keys per cache management\n[\"dashboard\"]                    // Dashboard data\n[\"people\"]                       // People list\n[\"people\", id]                   // Single person\n[\"projects\"]                     // Projects list\n[\"projects\", id]                 // Single project\n[\"projects\", id, \"conversations\"] // Project conversations\n[\"projects\", id, \"requirements\"]  // Project requirements\n[\"projects\", id, \"milestones\"]    // Project milestones\n[\"projects\", id, \"collaborators\"] // Project collaborators\n[\"projects\", id, \"plans\"]         // Project plans\n[\"projects\", id, \"files\"]         // Project files\n```\n\n### Mutations con Optimistic Updates\n\n\n[254 more lines in file. Use offset=800 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777794975363}}
{"type":"message","id":"4901ef6b","parentId":"d02b92c2","timestamp":"2026-05-03T07:56:46.912Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have everything I need. Let me spawn a sub-agent with DeepSeek V4 Code to build the frontend. The subagent task needs to include:\n\n1. Project structure and location\n2. Backend API details (base URL, endpoints, response format)\n3. Full component tree and route map\n4. Auth flow details\n5. Data flow / TanStack Query patterns\n6. The complete file-by-file checklist\n7. Specific instructions for each build step (B1-B5)\n\nLet me create a comprehensive task.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_vFUgLOfByra36Jd5w2Fl3389","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"## Costruisci il Frontend di Ensoria OS (CRM)\n\n### Dove\nCrea TUTTI i file in: `/Users/alessio/.openclaw/workspace/ensoria-ui/`\n\n### Backend API (già funzionante su http://localhost:3000)\n- `POST /api/auth/register` — `{ email, password, name }` → `{ data: { user, token } }`\n- `POST /api/auth/login` — `{ email, password }` → `{ data: { user, token } }`\n- `GET /api/auth/me` — Bearer token → `{ data: { user } }`\n- `GET /api/people` — `?type=&stage=&search=` → `{ data: [...] }`\n- `POST /api/people` — `{ name, type?, email?, phone?, company?, stage?, notes?, tags? }` → `{ data }`\n- `PUT /api/people/:id` — same fields → `{ data }`\n- `PATCH /api/people/:id/stage` — `{ stage }` → `{ data }`\n- `DELETE /api/people/:id` → `{ data: { success: true } }`\n- `GET /api/projects` — `?stage=&peopleId=&search=` → `{ data: [...] }`\n- `POST /api/projects` — `{ name, description?, value?, stage?, peopleId }` → `{ data }`\n- `PUT /api/projects/:id` → `{ data }`\n- `PATCH /api/projects/:id/stage` — `{ stage }` → `{ data }`\n- `DELETE /api/projects/:id` → `{ data }`\n- `GET /api/projects/:id` — includes all nested relations → `{ data }`\n- `GET/POST /api/projects/:id/conversations`\n- `GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/projects/:id/requirements` + `/:reqId`\n- `GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/projects/:id/milestones` + `/:msId`\n- `GET/POST/DELETE /api/projects/:id/collaborators` + `/:collabId`\n- `GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/projects/:id/plans` + `/:planId`\n- `GET/POST /api/projects/:id/files`\n- `GET /api/dashboard` — Bearer token → `{ data: { metrics, stageDistribution, recentActivity, projectsByStage } }`\n\nStandard response format: success = `{ data: ... }`, error = `{ error: { code, message, details? } }`\n\n### Tech Stack\n- **Framework:** React 19 + TypeScript\n- **Build:** Vite 6\n- **CSS:** Tailwind CSS v4\n- **UI Library:** shadcn/ui (copy components, no dependency)\n- **Routing:** React Router v7\n- **Server State:** TanStack Query v5\n- **Client State:** Zustand v5\n- **HTTP:** fetch (native) with wrapper\n\n### Build Order — Completa TUTTI questi step\n\n#### B1 — Scaffold\nCrea:\n- `package.json` with all deps (react, react-dom, react-router-dom, @tanstack/react-query, zustand, tailwindcss, vite, typescript, etc.)\n- `tsconfig.json`, `tsconfig.app.json`, `tsconfig.node.json`\n- `vite.config.ts` (proxy `/api` to `http://localhost:3000` so dev doesn't need CORS issues)\n- `tailwind.config.ts` (v4 — use `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin)\n- `postcss.config.js`\n- `index.html`\n- `src/main.tsx` — entry point\n- `src/index.css` — Tailwind imports + global styles\n- `src/vite-env.d.ts`\n\nIMPORTANT: For Tailwind CSS v4 in Vite, use `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin. The `index.css` should have: `@import \"tailwindcss\";`\n\n#### B2 — App Setup\n- `src/App.tsx` — BrowserRouter + QueryClientProvider + Routes structure:\n  ```\n  /login → LoginPage\n  /register → RegisterPage\n  (protected) / → DashboardPage\n  (protected) /people → PeoplePage\n  (protected) /people/:id → PeopleDetailPage\n  (protected) /projects → ProjectsPage\n  (protected) /projects/:id → ProjectSpacePage\n  (protected) /settings → SettingsPage\n  ```\n- `src/components/layout/AppLayout.tsx` — Sidebar (🏠 Dashboard, 👤 People, 📊 Projects, ⚙️ Settings) + Header (logo, user avatar, logout) + `<Outlet />`\n- `src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx` — Navigation with active state, collapse/expand\n- `src/components/layout/Header.tsx` — Search bar (Cmd+K placeholder), user avatar dropdown with logout\n- `src/components/shared/ProtectedRoute.tsx` — Checks token in localStorage, calls GET /api/auth/me, redirects to /login if 401\n\n#### B3 — Auth UI\n- `src/lib/api.ts` — fetch wrapper with base URL + Bearer token injection + JSON handling\n- `src/lib/utils.ts` — `cn()` helper (clsx + tailwind-merge)\n- `src/lib/auth.ts` — Token get/set/remove from localStorage helpers\n- `src/stores/authStore.ts` — Zustand store: user, token, isLoading, login(), register(), logout(), checkAuth()\n- `src/pages/LoginPage.tsx` — Email + password form, calls store.login(), redirects to /\n- `src/pages/RegisterPage.tsx` — Name + email + password form, calls store.register(), redirects to /\n\n#### B4 — API Layer (TanStack Query hooks)\nCreate ALL these hooks in `src/hooks/`:\n- `useAuth.ts` — useQuery for /me, useMutation for login/register\n- `usePeople.ts` — useQuery([\"people\", filters], GET /api/people), useMutation for create/update/delete/stage-change with optimistic updates\n- `useProjects.ts` — Same pattern for projects\n- `useConversations.ts` — Queries for project conversations\n- `useRequirements.ts` — CRUD for requirements nested under project\n- `useMilestones.ts` — CRUD for milestones\n- `useCollaborators.ts` — GET/POST/DELETE\n- `usePlans.ts` — CRUD\n- `useDashboard.ts` — useQuery([\"dashboard\"], GET /api/dashboard)\n\n#### B5 — shadcn/ui Components\nCreate ALL these in `src/components/ui/` (full implementations, not just stubs):\n- `button.tsx`, `input.tsx`, `card.tsx`, `badge.tsx`, `dialog.tsx`, `dropdown-menu.tsx`, `select.tsx`, `tabs.tsx`, `table.tsx`, `textarea.tsx`, `label.tsx`, `separator.tsx`, `avatar.tsx`, `skeleton.tsx`, `toast.tsx`\n\nAnd shared components in `src/components/shared/`:\n- `LoadingSpinner.tsx`, `EmptyState.tsx`, `ErrorMessage.tsx`\n\n#### B6 — Pages (complete implementations)\nCreate ALL pages with real data from TanStack Query hooks:\n\n- `src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx` — 4 MetricCards (totalPeople, totalProjects, pipelineValue, winRate), mini Kanban (projectsByStage columns as cards), ActivityFeed (list of recent activity with types)\n- `src/pages/PeoplePage.tsx` — Search + filter bar, PeopleTable (columns: name, type, stage with colored badge, email, company), Dialog with PeopleForm for create/edit\n- `src/pages/PeopleDetailPage.tsx` — Person card with info, stage badge, list of related projects\n- `src/pages/ProjectsPage.tsx` — KanbanBoard with 7 columns (Contact, Opportunity, Proposal, Implementation, Onboarding, Live, Validated), ProjectCards with value, name, people name. Stage change via click.\n- `src/pages/ProjectSpacePage.tsx` — Full page with 6 tabs: Conversations (feed + form), Files (list + form), Requirements (list + form + status dropdown), Roadmap (milestones list + form + progress), Collaborators (list + add/remove), Plans (list + form + version badge)\n- `src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx` — Basic placeholder\n\n### Styling\n- Dark theme (bg-gray-900/950, text-gray-100/300)\n- Accent purple (#a78bfa / violet-400)\n- Clean, modern look — follow shadcn/ui conventions\n- Responsive layout\n\n### CRITICAL — Crea TUTTI i file\nNon saltare niente. Ogni pagina deve essere completamente funzionante con dati reali dal backend. Usa TanStack Query hooks per tutti i dati. Le mutazioni devono aggiornare la cache dopo il successo.\n\nRun `npm install` and then `npm run dev` at the end to verify it compiles.","runtime":"subagent","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-code","label":"ensoria-ui-frontend"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":2004,"output":2245,"cacheRead":82816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87065,"cost":{"input":0.00028056,"output":0.0006286,"cacheRead":0.002318848,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.003228008}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777794975365,"responseId":"691bfc04-a34b-4cb4-bfc0-9fb5f7d33d3a"}}
