{"type":"message","id":"55ef6fbd","parentId":"2669fc72","timestamp":"2026-05-03T08:09:37.295Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Everything works end-to-end:\n- Backend on port 3000 ✅\n- Frontend on port 5173 ✅\n- Vite proxy routes /api to backend correctly ✅\n- Registration through the proxy works ✅\n\nNow let me give AleX a comprehensive status update.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Tutto funziona perfettamente end-to-end. Ecco il riepilogo completo:\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Ensoria OS — Full Stack Live\n\n### Backend (`ensoria-api/` → :3000)\n\n| Modulo | Stato | File |\n|--------|-------|------|\n| Scaffold + TypeScript | ✅ | `tsconfig.json`, `.env`, `package.json` (ESM) |\n| Prisma Schema | ✅ | 11 modelli, SQLite, generato + pushato |\n| App Setup | ✅ | Fastify 5, CORS, JWT, error handler |\n| Auth | ✅ | Register, Login, Me con JWT |\n| People | ✅ | CRUD + stage change + search/filter |\n| Projects | ✅ | CRUD + stage change + nested resources |\n| Conversations | ✅ | GET + POST under project |\n| Requirements | ✅ | Full CRUD |\n| Milestones | ✅ | Full CRUD |\n| Collaborators | ✅ | GET, POST, DELETE |\n| Plans | ✅ | CRUD + auto-versioning |\n| Files | ✅ | GET + POST |\n| Dashboard | ✅ | Metrics + stage distribution + activity |\n\n### Frontend (`ensoria-ui/` → :5173 → proxy :3000)\n\n| Modulo | Stato | File |\n|--------|-------|------|\n| Scaffold | ✅ | Vite 6 + React 19 + Tailwind v4 |\n| UI Components | ✅ | Button, Input, Textarea, Card, Badge, Dialog, Select, Tabs, Table |\n| Layout | ✅ | Sidebar (nav), Header (user + logout), AppLayout |\n| Auth | ✅ | LoginPage, RegisterPage, Zustand store |\n| API Layer | ✅ | 9 TanStack Query hooks (useAuth → useDashboard) |\n| Dashboard | ✅ | Metric cards + pipeline Kanban + Activity Feed |\n| People | ✅ | Table + search/filter + form dialog + stage dropdown |\n| People Detail | ✅ | Person card + related projects |\n| Projects | ✅ | KanbanBoard 7 colonne + form dialog |\n| Project Space | ✅ | 6 tabs (Conv, Files, Reqs, Roadmap, Collabs, Plans) |\n| Settings | ✅ | Placeholder |\n\n### Comandi per lanciare tutto\n\n```bash\n# Terminal 1 - Backend\ncd ~/.openclaw/workspace/ensoria-api && npm run dev\n\n# Terminal 2 - Frontend\ncd ~/.openclaw/workspace/ensoria-ui && npm run dev\n```\n\n**Vuoi fare review del codice prima di andare live?** O preferisci testare direttamente l'app in browser? 🚀"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":781,"output":630,"cacheRead":119296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":120707,"cost":{"input":0.00010934000000000001,"output":0.0001764,"cacheRead":0.003340288,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.003626028}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777795766721,"responseId":"b6994e58-ae85-4661-9671-cbc1186b230d"}}
